@startuml
title Debezium MySQL 初始快照的一致性边界

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #475569
  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #334155
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E0F2FE
}

participant "业务客户端" as app
participant "MySQL" as mysql
participant "Debezium" as dbz
participant "Offset 存储" as offset
participant "下游" as sink

dbz -> mysql : 获取 global read lock
dbz -> mysql : 开启 repeatable read 事务
dbz -> mysql : SHOW MASTER STATUS
mysql --> dbz : Binlog 位点 P / GTID
dbz -> mysql : 读取捕获表的 schema
dbz -> mysql : 释放 global read lock

app -> mysql : P 之后继续提交写入
mysql -> mysql : 记录到 Binlog

dbz -> mysql : 在一致性事务中扫描表
mysql --> dbz : P 时刻的行快照
dbz -> sink : snapshot read events
dbz -> offset : 标记 snapshot 完成，保存 P

dbz -> mysql : 从 P 开始读取 Binlog
mysql --> dbz : P 之后的 INSERT / UPDATE / DELETE / DDL
dbz -> sink : change events

note over mysql,offset
  P 是全量与增量的衔接点；
  不是“全量扫描结束”的墙上时间
end note

note over dbz,sink
  故障恢复可能从旧 offset 重放；
  下游必须按变更语义实现幂等
end note
@enduml
